#==============================================================================================
#
#   icu_enums - ICU 78.2's numbering of the enumerated properties
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       The value order of ICU's enumerations (unicode/uchar.h, unicode/uscript.h), by short
#       value alias. ppucd.txt names the values; these lists give them ICU's numbers, which
#       LibUnicode's API exposes and web_unicode keeps.
#
#==============================================================================================

